{
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "slug": "tag-input",
  "title": "Tag input",
  "group": "Inputs",
  "order": 10,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A field that turns typed text into removable tags: Enter or comma adds one, Backspace on an empty field removes the last. For several short free values.",
    "id": "Kolom yang mengubah teks ketikan menjadi tag yang bisa dihapus: Enter atau koma menambah satu, Backspace di kolom kosong menghapus yang terakhir. Untuk beberapa nilai bebas yang pendek."
  },
  "titleId": "Tag input",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Report keywords",
        "desc": "Type a keyword and press Enter or comma. Backspace in the empty field removes the last tag.",
        "html": "<div class=\"field\" style=\"max-width: 520px; width: 100%;\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"ti-in\">Keywords for the report</label>\n  <div class=\"control tags\"><span class=\"tag\">Pothole<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove Pothole\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span><span class=\"tag\">Blocked drain<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove Blocked drain\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span><span class=\"tag\">Street light<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove Street light\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span><input id=\"ti-in\" placeholder=\"Add a keyword\" enterkeyhint=\"enter\" aria-describedby=\"ti-help\" onkeydown=\"if ((event.key === 'Enter' || event.key === ',') && this.value.trim()) { event.preventDefault(); const t = document.createElement('span'); t.className = 'tag'; t.textContent = this.value.trim(); const b = document.createElement('button'); b.type = 'button'; b.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Remove ' + t.textContent); b.innerHTML = '&lt;span class=&quot;ic&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;close&lt;/span&gt;'; b.onclick = () => t.remove(); t.append(b); this.before(t); this.value = ''; } else if (event.key === 'Backspace' && !this.value) { const last = this.previousElementSibling; if (last) last.remove(); }\"></div>\n  <span class=\"field__help\" id=\"ti-help\">Up to 8 keywords. Press Enter after each one.</span>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"topics\">Keywords for the report</label>\n  <div class=\"control tags\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Pothole<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove Pothole\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span>\n    <span class=\"tag\">Street light<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove Street light\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span>\n    <input id=\"topics\" placeholder=\"Add a keyword\" aria-describedby=\"topics-help\">\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"field__help\" id=\"topics-help\">Up to 8 keywords. Press Enter after each one.</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Your code: Enter or comma adds a .tag before the input; Backspace on an empty input removes the last; each tag's button removes it. -->"
      },
      {
        "title": "Invite by email, with a rejected value",
        "desc": "Validate each value as it becomes a tag; keep the bad text in the input and explain.",
        "html": "<div class=\"field\" style=\"max-width: 520px; width: 100%;\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"ti-mail\">Invite fellow officers</label>\n  <div class=\"control tags is-invalid\"><span class=\"tag\">rani@example.go.id<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove rani@example.go.id\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span><span class=\"tag\">dimas@example.go.id<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove dimas@example.go.id\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span><input id=\"ti-mail\" type=\"email\" value=\"budi@example\" aria-invalid=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"ti-mail-help\"></div>\n  <span class=\"field__help field__help--error\" id=\"ti-mail-help\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">error</span>budi@example is missing a domain, like budi@example.go.id.</span>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Kata kunci laporan",
        "desc": "Ketik kata kunci lalu tekan Enter atau koma. Backspace di kolom kosong menghapus tag terakhir.",
        "html": "<div class=\"field\" style=\"max-width: 520px; width: 100%;\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"ti-in\">Kata kunci laporan</label>\n  <div class=\"control tags\"><span class=\"tag\">Jalan berlubang<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Hapus Jalan berlubang\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span><span class=\"tag\">Drainase tersumbat<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Hapus Drainase tersumbat\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span><span class=\"tag\">Lampu jalan<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Hapus Lampu jalan\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span><input id=\"ti-in\" placeholder=\"Tambah kata kunci\" enterkeyhint=\"enter\" aria-describedby=\"ti-help\" onkeydown=\"if ((event.key === 'Enter' || event.key === ',') && this.value.trim()) { event.preventDefault(); const t = document.createElement('span'); t.className = 'tag'; t.textContent = this.value.trim(); const b = document.createElement('button'); b.type = 'button'; b.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Hapus ' + t.textContent); b.innerHTML = '&lt;span class=&quot;ic&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;close&lt;/span&gt;'; b.onclick = () => t.remove(); t.append(b); this.before(t); this.value = ''; } else if (event.key === 'Backspace' && !this.value) { const last = this.previousElementSibling; if (last) last.remove(); }\"></div>\n  <span class=\"field__help\" id=\"ti-help\">Paling banyak 8 kata kunci. Tekan Enter setelah setiap kata kunci.</span>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"topics\">Kata kunci laporan</label>\n  <div class=\"control tags\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Jalan berlubang<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Hapus Jalan berlubang\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span>\n    <span class=\"tag\">Lampu jalan<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Hapus Lampu jalan\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span>\n    <input id=\"topics\" placeholder=\"Tambah kata kunci\" aria-describedby=\"topics-help\">\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"field__help\" id=\"topics-help\">Paling banyak 8 kata kunci. Tekan Enter setelah setiap kata kunci.</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Your code: Enter or comma inserts a .tag before the input; Backspace on an empty input removes the last; each tag's button removes it. -->"
      },
      {
        "title": "Undang lewat email, dengan nilai yang ditolak",
        "desc": "Validasi setiap nilai saat menjadi tag; biarkan teks yang salah di input dan jelaskan.",
        "html": "<div class=\"field\" style=\"max-width: 520px; width: 100%;\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"ti-mail\">Undang rekan petugas</label>\n  <div class=\"control tags is-invalid\"><span class=\"tag\">rani@example.go.id<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Hapus rani@example.go.id\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span><span class=\"tag\">dimas@example.go.id<button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Hapus dimas@example.go.id\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></span><input id=\"ti-mail\" type=\"email\" value=\"budi@example\" aria-invalid=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"ti-mail-help\"></div>\n  <span class=\"field__help field__help--error\" id=\"ti-mail-help\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">error</span>budi@example belum punya domain, misalnya budi@example.go.id.</span>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
